  "conclusions": [
    "No momentum overlay produces a statistically significant improvement over baseline 12/VIX (all p>0.05). Confirms the 'irreducible kernel' finding.",
    "SMA filter reduces MDD by 11.5% (-7.8% → -6.9%) with Sharpe change of -0.249. But at unacceptable Sharpe cost.",
    "Dual momentum (Antonacci-style) Sharpe=0.995 vs baseline 1.804. No improvement — asset switching adds complexity without reliable benefit for VT.",
    "OOS 2023-2024 was predominantly bullish (SMA bullish 97% of days, 12M momentum bullish 84%). Momentum filters rarely triggered 'bearish' regime, limiting their discriminative power.",
